# a text parsed as the program runs keeps where each node was written, as quoted code does (wiki/data.md "Quoted code
# remembers where it was written"); the place changes neither equality nor how the code shows
'parse("f() := {}" + "").op'	':='
'parse(" x" + "") == data x'	true
'text(parse("b := 1" + "")) == text(data (b := 1))'	true
'parse("a\nb := " + "1")#2.line'	2
